:: Forest - toll retaliation [bg-forest]
<h1 class="ptitle">FOREST</h1>
<br />

<<energy -30>>
<<addmins 90>>

You spend the better part of a day in the trees, following the path your workers use. No sign of him at first — just the usual sounds, the usual shadows. Then you catch it: smoke from a camp set back off the trail, barely visible through the undergrowth.
<br /><br />

<center>
    <<image 'places/forest/forest_toll_retaliation.jpg' sfw>>
</center>
<br />

There's one man. He's sitting on a crate, counting caps — not yours, but someone's. He hasn't heard you yet.
<br /><br />

<<link 'Confront him'>>
    <<generateEnemies 1>>
    <<fight $enemies 'Forest - toll retaliation won' 'Forest - toll retaliation lost'>>
<</link>>
